       as fully anonymous (SAS = empty in their own samples) and direct
       HTTPS reads succeed. Re-enable once the plugin's anonymous mode is
       fixed — append the entry below back into the `sources` list above
       (with a leading comma after the N2 entry):

  {
    "id": "N3",
    "uri": "wasbs://nyctlc@azureopendatastorage.blob.core.windows.net/yellow/puYear=*/puMonth=*/part-*.parquet",
    "format": "parquet", "codec": "snappy", "backend": "azure", "auth": "anonymous", "dataset": "nyc_taxis",
    "with": 'WITH { "auth": "none" }'
  }
--- #}

